    "detailed_description": "This game is a captivating puzzle platformer where players control a string of three square blocks that leap over gaps by pressing the space bar. Set against a blue geometric background with orange lines as steps, the objective is to catch three black squares on these platforms. Timing is key; players must carefully time their jumps to avoid falling into the gaps between the steps. Each game offers three chances to navigate through increasingly complex levels. The minimalist visuals and soothing sound effects create a serene atmosphere, making it easy to get lost in the challenge. With its simple yet addictive gameplay, this game provides hours of entertainment, testing both reflexes and strategy.",
